      "sourceTextSha256": "c7cf6e27816c622dcee47c2a1c2613f9f3f075872ef928febf62c085c68edbb4",
      "text": "Day 8 · Breakfast. Panoramic city tour of South America’s most European and cosmopolitan city. Drive along Avenida 9 de Julio, home to the renowned Teatro Colón and the Obelisk, symbols of the city, and visit Plaza de Mayo with the Casa Rosada, the Cathedral and the City Hall, then Plaza San Martín, the Alvear area and Plaza del Congreso, along Avenida de Mayo and lively Avenida Corrientes, through La Boca and San Telmo, Palermo, Recoleta and modern Puerto Madero.",
