    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "01717a37306c885f6a0e495bdd8aff969982bfeb5edda4cecdda410e3adcfeaa",
      "text": "Day 9 · Breakfast. Free time to discover the city or join an optional excursion: Fiesta Gaucha, Montevideo or Tigre (see Optional Excursions).\n\nFiesta Gaucha\n\nUSD 360 per person\n\nGroup tour, English guide\n\nArgentine wine and empanadas on arrival, horseback riding or a stroll in the countryside, the gaucho museum, a barbecue of premium beef and a folkloric dance and gaucho show.\n\nMontevideo (Uruguay)\n\nBuenos Aires · Day 9 · 8 hours\n\nUSD 600 per person\n\nGroup tour\n\nFerry to Montevideo via Colonia del Sacramento and a panoramic tour: Plaza Independencia, the Old Town, Teatro Solís, Palacio Salvo, the Legislative Palace, El Prado, Parque Batlle, Carrasco and Pocitos.\n\nTigre & Northern Zone\n\nUSD 120 per person\n\nA boat trip through the Tigre Delta and the life of the isleños, then the northern suburbs, San Isidro and the Presidential Residence.",
